# misdescribe what it contains.
#
# Reason: this is the first material in the programme carrying live, unawarded bid pricing in a
# tender that had not closed. The two Envision offers are marked Confidential on every page and
# their clause 6 requires prior, explicit and written authorization from Envision before any
# third-party communication; no such instrument is held. The second OEM quotation carries no
# confidentiality marking and no vendor name, so the absence of a marking is not a grant of
# permission and there is no issuing entity whose permission could be sought. Neither
# PUBLICATION_AUTHORIZATION.md, which enumerates four files from the 6 August 2026 tranche, nor
# the 29 August reversal, which turned on material forming part of the bid submitted to NSO,
# reaches supplier pricing given to the bidder pre-award.
